Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.98,Hook,,0,0,0,,¿Y EL SILENCIADOR?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Espera, ¿dónde está el\Nsilenciador?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:04.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Prueba de sonido número\Ndos, a ver mi arma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:14.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Regresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No la modifiqué.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Y estos quieren pelea\Nconmigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:22.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oye, oye, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:23.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oye, cuida esa boca.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:24.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Si no te estoy sacando el\Ndedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me estoy tratando de\Nquitar la máscara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:31.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ay, botón equivocado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Por eso estaba sacando el\Ndedo todo el tiempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:34.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ya lo tiene puesto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:35.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, espera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No lo tengo equipado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:40.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Soy un idiota.
